  "title": "Easy Instant Pot® Cocktail Meatballs",
  "description": "A twist on the grape jelly cocktail meatballs that everybody loves. This appetizer recipe uses apricot preserves, but feel free to use grape, orange marmalade, or even cranberry sauce.",
